# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT — FLEXMETAL

## Role and objective

Act as a senior UI/UX designer, creative director, frontend engineer, backend engineer, and software architect with extensive experience building premium industrial and architectural e-commerce websites.

Build a complete, sophisticated, responsive, full-stack website for **FLEXMETAL**, a company specializing in roller shutters, roller gates, industrial doors, security shutters, automated gates, and related products.

The application must combine:

- A premium industrial corporate website
- A modern e-commerce product catalog
- A professional installation portfolio
- A configurable shopping and quotation system
- An administrative management dashboard
- Customer inquiry and contact functionality

**Critical requirement:** I have attached a screenshot of the visual design I want. Treat that screenshot as the PRIMARY VISUAL REFERENCE.

Reproduce its aesthetic as closely as possible, especially the homepage navigation, typography, background treatment, visual hierarchy, spacing, colors, buttons, and hero composition.

Do not interpret the screenshot as a generic inspiration. It is the visual foundation of this project.

Extend its visual language consistently throughout the entire website.

The finished result should look like a premium website created by a professional digital design agency for a high-end industrial engineering brand.

Do not produce an ordinary template, dashboard-like marketing website, or a collection of unrelated components.

Build a cohesive, realistic, polished application with functional navigation and interactive features.

