For example:
- "Added to cart"
- "Quote request submitted"
- "Please enter a valid phone number"
- "Unable to save. Please try again."

Never show false success messages when a backend operation fails.

For demo-only interactions, explicitly indicate demo status.

Use progressive enhancement where practical.

