# 15. Local business and commerce configuration

The website should initially support a Sri Lankan business context without hardcoding assumptions about the final company location.

Default currency:
LKR

Support:
- Sri Lankan phone number formats
- Configurable +94 WhatsApp number
- District/location entry
- Custom measurements in millimeters
- Installation request functionality
- Product quote requests
- Manual order inquiry workflows

Store prices as numeric values in a consistent currency model.

Only display actual configured prices.

Custom roller shutters must not receive automatically invented prices.

Do not automatically integrate payment gateways or charge customers.

Keep payment provider integration as an optional future extension.

